{"current_step": 0, "is_session_active": false, "last_prompt": null, "canvas_ready": false, "results": [], "timestamp": null, "step": 9, "search_results": "## Search Results\n\n[HOW TO DRAW A HOUSE EASY - YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftVUrNbAVeY)\n HOW  TO  DRAW  A  HOUSE EASYDRAWING A HOUSEhow to draw  a  house easy step by stepDrawing and coloring, draw , coloring, how  to  draw , kawaii drawings, pencil sketch...\n\n[How to Draw a House: 11 Steps (with Pictures) - wikiHow](https://www.wikihow.com/Draw-a-House)\n Draw in the finishing details to complete your house . You can crosshatch the side of the roof to create shingles and draw  a chimney on top of the roof. To make the door and windows look more realistic, shade them in and draw  a small circle on the door for a doorknob. You can even add a fence and draw some trees so your house has a yard.\n\n[How to Draw a House Step by Step - EasyArtStart](https://www.easyartstart.com/how-to-draw-a-house-step-by-step/)\nLearn how  to  draw  a simple and stylized house with nine easy steps. Follow the illustrated examples and instructions to outline the foundation, roof, windows, door, chimney and more.\n\n[House Drawing - How To Draw A House Step By Step - I Heart Crafty Things](https://iheartcraftythings.com/house-drawing.html)\nWhen creating this house drawing, you can use real-life examples of houses  to help you out. You could use your own house or find a nice one in your neighborhood that you can take a photo of. Having a real-life house  to use can help you not only get the proportions and details right but can also give you inspiration for your drawing of a house .\n\n[Learn How to Draw a House Step by Step - My Modern Met](https://mymodernmet.com/how-to-draw-a-house/)\nFollow nine easy steps with illustrations to draw  a simple house using geometric shapes. You'll need a pencil, eraser, pen, paper, and reference photos to create your own cityscape.\n\n[How to Draw a House - HelloArtsy](https://helloartsy.com/how-to-draw-a-house/)\nLearn how  to  draw  a  house in 6 easy steps with this printable PDF guide. Follow along with the illustrations and color the house with crayons or pencils.\n\n[How to Draw a House - Color Made Happy](https://colormadehappy.com/how-to-draw-a-house/)\nLearn how  to  draw  a basic house with simple shapes and details in this beginner-friendly tutorial. Follow the instructions and examples to create your own cozy home or try different styles and decorations.\n\n[How to Draw a House Step By Step - For Kids & Beginners](https://how-to-drawa.com/house/)\nLearn how  to  draw  a  house with geometrical shapes and simple steps. See examples of different types of houses , buildings, and cartoons, and color your drawings with your choice of colors.\n\n[How to Draw a House Step By Step - Incredible Drawings](https://incredibledrawings.com/how-to-draw-a-house-step-by-step/)\nStart by drawing a simple house shape. Draw  a square with a triangle on top to form the basic outline of the house . Step 2: Add the Roof Outline. Next, add a second outline to the roof. Draw another triangle slightly above the first one and connect the edges to the sides of the house . This will give the roof a nice, finished look.\n\n[How to Draw a House - A Fun and Easy House Drawing Guide - artincontext.org](https://artincontext.org/how-to-draw-a-house/)\nLearn how  to  draw  a  house with perspective and dimension using a few basic tools and techniques. Follow the step-by-step instructions and examples to create your own house sketch with a rustic and vintage style.", "canvas_image_base64": ""}